            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "anythingonce"
            },
            "reviewBody": "You just can't beat fresh toms! Prepared this way they are tasty and way easy. I am however anti sugar in them. Add some crumbled bacon &amp; black pepper and serve over a hot bed of white rice and you've got a great Southern side dish.",
