              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BrightTea6049"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I use this recipe as a \"base\" for any recipe that calls for \"stewed tomatoes\" ! So much better than canned tomatoes and I know where the tomatoes came from: my fully organic non-gmo garden!!!!! I know the full ingredients and it makes truly the best tasting recipes, salsa &amp; all amazingly fresh. I mix all my tomatoes together, Dad's sunset, Roma, Beef steak, Creole, Raspberry Layanna, ect. Yes it is worth the extra time to know what is going into my family.",
            "datePublished": "2022-07-29T15:07:02.323Z"
